{
  "app_id": 4301300,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Incrempire is an incremental survival game where you have to help defend your kingdom from the incoming hordes of monsters. You cannot win every battle, but each defeat makes you even stronger. Hover your cursor over the incoming enemies to slay them. Defeated enemies give you money! Spend your money on the skill tree. Unlock mighty spells or boost your stats permanently to defeat even the strongest enemies. Before each run, choose a temporary blessing. Every battle feels unique. 25 levels 5 unique biomes 50 achievements 4-6 hours of gameplay depending on your strategy and playstyle"
  },
